  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A test fails on origin/master: the held-email alert and a grant reminder with DaysLeft &lt;= 7 write priority 200000001; otherwise 200000000.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Must-not-fire: NotificationService.CreateNotificationAsync with priority 200000002 throws ArgumentOutOfRangeException and writes nothing; a Hidden toast gets no Open action; other callers unchanged.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Build, filtered Notification/Jobs/ExternalAccess tests, full ArchTests pass; publish-size delta reported. The main session closes PR #1494 with a pointer after this merges.</criterion>
