  <completion>Done 2026-11-27: PR #3286 squash-merged to master (fb2fdf3c61; #1697) after an independent Opus adversarial review and one fix round (snapshot test renamed; opt-in live metadata test, run by the main session read-only against dev: 1 passed). App notifications use the valid priority, toast type and icon type option values. Superseded PR #1494 to be closed on the owner's go. On dev with the uac-r2 dev BFF deploy of 5cd40984b0 (2026-11-27, master 765a199922).</completion>
